[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Install to internal disk
Name[zh_CN]=安装系统到内置硬盘
Comment=Clone the running USB system to the internal disk (erases all data on it)
Comment[zh_CN]=将当前 U 盘系统整盘克隆到内置硬盘（目标盘数据将被清空）
# 用 pkexec 走 polkit 图形认证: 不依赖 NOPASSWD sudo, 触屏误点图标也不会直达擦盘确认
Exec=pkexec /usr/local/bin/gaokun-install
Terminal=true
Icon=drive-harddisk
Categories=System;
